    - id: 2
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 0:03 - 0:25
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: FUNDAMENTALS OF BUSINESS
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Well, hello, and welcome to the fundamentals of business. And this
          is the you pillar. And this \r\nis probably the most important part, I
          can't stress enough how important it is to really \r\nunderstand this within
          your business, so that it actually builds solid foundations. "
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: AudioWait(Cathy Audio Clips/00_3-00_25)
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 1
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 1
        originDialogueID: 2
        destinationConversationID: 1
        destinationDialogueID: 3
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 161
        y: 153.82355
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 3
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "If you're ready, let me actually walk you through that. But before
          we begin, let's actually just \r\nget a few things organized. So sometimes
          we actually think that we can do two things at \r\nonce. "
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: AudioWait(Cathy Audio Clips/0_25- 0_53)
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 1
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 1
        originDialogueID: 3
        destinationConversationID: 1
        destinationDialogueID: 4
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 157.81818
        y: 230.3013
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 4
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "And let me tell you, someone who has always been known as being able
          to multitask, I can \r\ntell you that there is no way that we can possibly
          be at our best whilst we're actually doing \r\ntwo things, we can't focus
          on two things at the same time. I actually call that multi \r\nswitching.
          So please make sure that you're actually paying attention, you get rid
          of all the \r\ndistractions. "
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: AudioWait(Cathy Audio Clips/0-50- 01_18)
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 1
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 1
        originDialogueID: 4
        destinationConversationID: 1
        destinationDialogueID: 5
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 159.2967
        y: 301.45053
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "And most importantly, you actually have your phone switched off,
          because it is a distraction. \r\nSo get yourself comfortable and be ready
          to actually share this journey with us. Do you \r\nknow, I wanted to, of
          course, share a little bit about me, because whilst this is actually a
          you \r\nsection, I think that there might be some either perceptions or
          perspectives of who I am. "
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: AudioWait(Cathy Audio Clips/1_18- 01_50)
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 1
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 1
        originDialogueID: 5
        destinationConversationID: 1
        destinationDialogueID: 6
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 158.65498
        y: 366.91513
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 6
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "So I want to share a little bit about who I am, but more importantly,
          what brought me on \r\nthis journey. And this really allows you to think
          about where you're at today, and more \r\nimportantly, where you want to
          go. So as you can see, I have a real big belief that we bring \r\nthe whole
          of ourselves into everything that we do."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: AudioWait(Cathy Audio Clips/1_54 - 2_16)
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 1
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 1
        originDialogueID: 6
        destinationConversationID: 1
        destinationDialogueID: 7
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 158.1978
        y: 423.1289
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 7
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "We're not a different person, when we're actually at work to who
          we are, when we are in \r\nour private lives. And I come to that conclusion,
          because I look at it from the lens of or the \r\nperspective of my values
          don't change. My values are actually integrated into everything \r\nthat
          I do."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: AudioWait(Cathy Audio Clips/2_16 - 2_36)
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 1
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 1
        originDialogueID: 7
        destinationConversationID: 1
        destinationDialogueID: 8
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 158.91708
        y: 480.74133
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 8
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "So whilst a task might actually be more relevant in what I'm doing
          at work, to that of my \r\nprivate life, that's not being the whole of
          you is not what it's about. It's about genuinely \r\nbringing the same
          perspective, the same values, the way that you would actually relate to
          \r\npeople in your private life, to the way that you would relate to them
          in your business and in \r\nyour vocation as well. "
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: AudioWait(Cathy Audio Clips/2_37 - 3_16)
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 1
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 1
        originDialogueID: 8
        destinationConversationID: 1
        destinationDialogueID: 9
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 158.9171
        y: 542.82916
        width: 160
        height: 30
